------------------+-------------+-------------+----------------------+-----------------+-------------------+------------
 JOIN_UPDATE_ITEM | Books       |          50 |  50.0000000000000000 |              50 |                 1 |          1
 JOIN_UPDATE_ITEM | Clothing    |         100 | 100.0000000000000000 |             100 |                 1 |          1
